sequenceDiagram
    participant GP as "Game Provider"
    participant SP as "SP (Service Platform)"
    participant OP as "Operator"

    GP->>SP: PlaceBet (ticket)
    alt Promotion Ticket (promotionId != null)
        SP->>SP: Track promotional PlaceBet (Amount, ContributionAmount, etc.)
        Note right of SP: Do NOT send PlaceBet to Operator
    else Normal Ticket (promotionId == null)
        SP->>OP: PlaceBet (original Amount, ContributionAmount)
    end

    GP->>SP: EndGame (ticket)
    alt Promotion Ticket (promotionId != null)
        SP->>SP: Track promotional EndGame (TotalAmount, TotalWin, ValidBetAmount)
        Note right of SP: Do NOT send EndGame to Operator
    else Normal Ticket (promotionId == null)
        SP->>OP: EndGame (original TotalAmount, TotalWin, ValidBetAmount)
    end 